        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017245",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, because we offer a consistent, optimized set of floor plans and home options across our markets, we can reduce costs, shorten construction cycle times, and ultimately deliver a high-quality personalized home at an attractive price point, which averaged approximately $334,000 on homes closed during the year ended December 31, 2025.",
